.TH BLACKDIAMOND 1
.SH NAME
blackdiamond \- downhill skiing game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/blackdiamond
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I BlackDiamond
is a downhill skiing game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Ski 3000 pixels downhill past trees, rocks and wolves to the finish.
Wolves chase the skier while they are on screen.
A chair-lift cable spans the sky above its base tower.
Every frame spent overlapping an obstacle adds to the penalty
(and holds a warning tone); the lowest penalty is kept as the best score.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left
Move skier left (wrap)
.TP
.B Right
Move skier right (wrap)
.TP
.B Up
Climb back uphill
.TP
.B Down
Skip ahead downhill
.TP
.B space / r
Give up: ski back to the top, then restart the same course
.TP
.B Enter
New game on a fresh random course, any time
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/blackdiamond.b
